{"id":"bola","lemma":"bola","pos":"noun","rank":1471,"glosses":["ball","testicle","scoop"],"ipa":"/ˈbola/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"bolas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/09/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-bola.wav","examples":[{"text":"Por favor, lanza la bola.","en":"Please throw the ball.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/459713"},{"text":"Las bolas son redondas.","en":"Balls are round.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/734355"},{"text":"¿Puedes lanzar una bola rápida?","en":"Can you throw a fastball?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/611647"},{"text":"Tuvimos una pelea de bolas de nieve.","en":"We had a snowball fight."},{"text":"Tom lanzó la bola a Mary.","en":"Tom tossed the ball to Mary."}]}